==Trivia==
[[File:PK13 error.png|thumb|200px|Forretress's miscolored spikes]]
* This [[Pikachu short]] was released between [[AG087]] and [[AG088]] in Japan.
* This is the first Pikachu short to not be dubbed into English.
* This is the first Pikachu short to have a narrator and have the Pokémon's dialogue translated by the narrator.
* This Pikachu short was released on DVD in {{pmin|Taiwan}} and {{pmin|Hong Kong}}.
* This Pikachu short premiered on {{pmin|Indonesia}}n TV on July 13, 2008.
* [[Pokémon Ondo]] is played in the background at the beginning of this Pikachu short.
* [[Christmas Eve]] is sung by the {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} during the festival.

===Errors===
* When the {{p|Bellsprout}} arrives at the festival, {{TP|Brock|Forretress}}'s spikes are colored purple like its shell instead of red.
* {{TP|Jessie|Wobbuffet}} uses {{m|Counter}} to send {{m|Thunder Wave}} back to {{p|Magnemite}}, despite Thunder Wave not being a physical attack.

